<h2 id="registry" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. Area registry contract</h2>

Register each glossary paragraph area in one place (Python + thin web mirror as needed):

| Field | Example (adjectives) | Example (This/that) |
|-------|----------------------|---------------------|
| `area_id` | `adjectives` | `determiners` |
| `scope` | `adjectives:endings` | `determiners:demonstratives` |
| `mode` | `adjective_pairs` | `demonstratives` |
| `content_type` | `gender_adjective_pattern` | `article_paradigm` |
| `blank_fields` | `fem`, `masc`, `fem_pl`, `masc_pl` | `form` (singular only) |
| `control` | textbox | textbox |
