| `admin_path` | `/admin/other-words/paragraph` | `/admin/other-words/paragraph` |
| `pool` | adjective pattern rows | demonstrative singular paradigm rows |

**Blank JSON** must carry at least: `slot`, `blank_kind` (`form` for fill-the-surface; keep `leading`/`noun` for noun-agreement), `content_id`, `expected`, optional `field`, optional `select_options`, and cue/`meaning_en` for UI brackets per [§2.7](#meaning-brackets) (from Basic `other_shown_cols`, not knowledge-only Note).

Persist in `gender_paragraph_exercise` (namespaced `scope`) **or** a later shared glossary table — prefer **namespaced scope on the existing table** until a dedicated migration is justified. Keep `nouns_list` as the human item list string (lemmas / forms).

