<h2 id="frontend" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">7. Frontend checklist</h2>

1. Unhold Paragraph practice in `conjugationSuiteConfig` for the area; include `/practice/<area>/paragraph` in `pathPrefixes` if needed.
2. Routes in `App.tsx` for learner; add/reuse the **one top-level-glossary paragraph-admin route + chip**.
3. Learner page: list exercises, `ParagraphBlankExerciseItem`, map `blank_kind`/`field` → text vs select (mirror Basic).
4. Admin page: Generate scope (all paragraph-enabled areas in that top-level glossary), dynamic checklist, N, Varieties, Dry run, Generate, Delete, DataGrid + expand + telemetry.
5. Path mirror Knowledge ↔ Basic ↔ Paragraph.
6. **Nouns checklist labels:** `GET …/paragraph/lemmas` returns L1 **gloss** (Hint / Meaning — same text as paragraph `[…]` brackets per [§2.7](#meaning-brackets)) for every row; UI shows **`lemma (gloss)`** only when the same **lemma spelling** appears more than once in that scope’s catalog (`duplicateLemmaSpellings` + `formatLemmaChecklistTitle` / `NounChecklistControl`). Unique spellings stay bare `lemma`. Never show duplicate spellings without a distinguishing gloss in the dropdown.
7. Vitest and/or Playwright mocked: route live, Submit grades, admin generate dry-run/mock.

