<h2 id="do-not" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">8. Do not</h2>

- Do **not** invent paragraph blanks for knowledge columns Basic does not grade.
- Do **not** put Basic-knowledge-only fields (e.g. long pedagogy Notes) into paragraph `[…]` brackets — brackets follow [§2.7](#meaning-brackets) / Basic `other_shown_cols` only.
- Do **not** use Basic-grid chrome (`PracticeGroupedTable`) for paragraph blanks — use `ParagraphBlankExerciseItem`.
- Do **not** local-only grade without `record_attempt` / registry identity.
- Do **not** copy-paste a third LLM loop outside LPL/PGLPL.
- Do **not** force every area into the conjugation verb×tense admin; glossary areas use **Generate scope + item checklist**.
- Do **not** create one paragraph-admin chip/page per knowledge area. The top-level glossary is the admin boundary; areas are Generate scopes.
- Do **not** over-abstract before the second glossary area ships — extract a shared admin/learner shell when **adjectives and determiners** (or noun + one new area) would otherwise duplicate &gt;~one screen of JSX.
- **Shipped extract:** `ParagraphAdminShell` for Noun + Other Word paragraph admins; `GlossaryParagraphPracticePage` / thin page adapters under `apps/web/src/pages/glossary/` — do not fork a third admin page copy for the next glossary area.
- **LPL expand:** when generate retries fail, admin expand lists `gen_lpl_attempt_errors` (attempt · phase · reason) above the `rg` log tip; produce prompts include repair hints on retry.

