<h2 id="examples" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">10. Worked examples</h2>

### 10.1 Describing words (adjectives)

- Basic: fill Fem / Masc / Fem plural / Masc plural (textbox).
- Paragraph: blanks are agreeing **forms** (`field` one of the four); textbox controls.
- Scope: `adjectives:endings` · mode `adjective_pairs` · type `gender_adjective_pattern`.

### 10.2 This/that (determiners)

- Basic: fill **singular** Form only.
- Paragraph: blanks are singular demonstrative **forms** (`field=form` or omit); textbox; do not require plurals.
- Scope: `determiners:demonstratives` · mode `demonstratives` · type `article_paradigm`.

### 10.3 Blending words (contractions)

- Basic: fill **singular** fused Form only (knowledge may show `no(s)`).
- Paragraph: blanks are singular fused **forms** (`field=form`); textbox.
- Scope: `contractions:blending` · mode `contractions` · type `place_contraction_map`.
- Admin: additive Generate scope on `/admin/other-words/paragraph` (not a new midlevel chip).
- Register matrix (`REFACTOR_BLENDING_WORDS_REGISTER_MATRIX.md`): knowledge/Basic
  read `presentation_tier` (`table` vs `bottom_list`) and the four `ok_*`
  register flags from `place_contraction_map` — Basic and knowledge tables
  exclude `bottom_list` rows; paragraph admin/generate pool uses the same
  `presentation_tier` gate (singular + not bottom_list). Places still mirrors
  fusions in a hardcoded dict until the linked
  `REFACTOR_FUSION_CONSUMERS_FROM_BLENDING_DATA.md` plan rewires it.
- Personal table includes **comigo/contigo/consigo/conosco** (`com` band); place-adverb table includes **dentre** and **doravante**. Literary rarities (`convosco`, `daquém`, …) stay bottom-list. Plan: [`REFACTOR_BLENDING_COMIGO_DENTRE_DORAVANTE.md`](../../cursor_gen/refactor_plans/completed/REFACTOR_BLENDING_COMIGO_DENTRE_DORAVANTE.md).

### 10.4 Making plurals (Noun & agreement)

- Basic: fill **Plural** textbox; **Singular** shown (+ Meaning cue); bands by `rule_group`.
- Paragraph: blanks are plural **forms** (`blank_kind=form`, `field=plural`); textbox.
- Scope: `plural:plural` · mode `plural` · type `noun_plural_rule`.
- Admin: Generate scope on `/admin/gender-nouns/paragraph` (Noun glossary owner — not Other Word). Grid is **scope-filtered** via that Generate scope (shared table with Other Word).
- Plan: [`REFACTOR_PLURAL_BASIC_AND_PARAGRAPH_PRACTICE.md`](../../cursor_gen/refactor_plans/completed/REFACTOR_PLURAL_BASIC_AND_PARAGRAPH_PRACTICE.md).

### 10.5 Para v.s. Por (Other Word)

- Basic: fill **Word** textbox (`por` / `para`); Meaning shown; bands `para_forward` / `por_backward`.
- Paragraph: blanks are **word** (`field=word`); accept lemma + fused aliases from `surface_note` / example.
- Scope: `por-para:main` · mode `por_para` · type `article_prep_semantic_rule`.
- Admin: Generate scope on `/admin/other-words/paragraph`.
- Generation: Alt A + sense-anchor (**[`§2.6`](#sense-anchor)**) via `PorParaNaturalPromptAdapter` (`needs_sense_anchors=True`). Unmarked extra lemmas stay prose.
- Plan: [`REFACTOR_PARA_VS_POR_OTHER_WORD_GLOSSARY.md`](../../cursor_gen/refactor_plans/completed/REFACTOR_PARA_VS_POR_OTHER_WORD_GLOSSARY.md).

### 10.6 Place Glossary (all atlas + gentílico chips)

- Basic: article chips fill **Article** select (`o`/`a`/`os`/`as`/`—`); gentílico chips fill **masc**/**fem** text.
- Paragraph: one Generate scope per chip (`places:continents` … `places:gentilicos-city`).
- Article blanks: `field=article`, **select** (`select_options`); unselected sentinel `""` → ▼ (not `—`); literal `—` stays a graded option when present.
- **Host-leading: ON** ([§2.6b](#host-leading)): natural contractions preferred; local ban on unfused `em o`/`de o`; inject blanks preceding article **or** fusion; grade/dropdown = blanked surface family.
- **Null-article lock:** place rows with no definite article (DB NULL / UI `—`) are **excluded** from article-chip paragraph pools (nothing to punch for Alt A).
- Gentílico blanks: `field` masc/fem text only (no invented article blanks); **surface inject** (host-leading OFF).
- **Sense-anchor: OFF**.
- Admin: `/admin/places/paragraph` (Place Glossary top-level — not Other Word).
- Learner paths: `/practice/places/paragraph/atlas/{chip}`.
- Plan: [`REFACTOR_PLACE_NUMBER_GLOSSARY_PARAGRAPH.md`](../../cursor_gen/refactor_plans/completed/REFACTOR_PLACE_NUMBER_GLOSSARY_PARAGRAPH.md) · [`REFACTOR_PLACE_ARTICLE_HOST_LEADING_INJECT.md`](../../cursor_gen/refactor_plans/completed/REFACTOR_PLACE_ARTICLE_HOST_LEADING_INJECT.md) · [`REFACTOR_PLACE_HOST_LEADING_CONTRACTIONS.md`](../../cursor_gen/refactor_plans/completed/REFACTOR_PLACE_HOST_LEADING_CONTRACTIONS.md).

### 10.7 Number Glossary (cardinals + ordinals)

- Basic: cardinals fill **Form** (Number shown); ordinals fill **masc**/**fem** (Rank shown).
- Paragraph: scopes `numbers:cardinals` (`field=form`) and `numbers:ordinals` (`field` masc/fem); textbox; `content_type=number_form`.
- Brackets ([§2.7](#meaning-brackets)): **Number** / **Rank** — not knowledge Note (e.g. not `Compound / year example · BR: …`).
- **Sense-anchor: OFF** (default 2-call Alt A).
